### 1. Signup API
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@shelterx.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login API (Returns JWT Token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@shelterx.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Run Thermal & Shelter Simulation API
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/sih/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "location": "Ladakh",
  "lat": 34.1526,
  "lon": 77.5771,
  "dimensions": {
    "width": 5,
    "length": 6,
    "height": 3
  },
  "targetTemp": 20,
  "orientation": "South-Facing",
  "roofMaterial": "PUF Insulated Panels",
  "wallThickness_mm": 150
}
